    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367590/extras/d50a7a89e6185ba5cb3f5bcc0b793fc2.poster.avif?t=1746352603\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367590/extras/d50a7a89e6185ba5cb3f5bcc0b793fc2.webm?t=1746352603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367590/extras/d50a7a89e6185ba5cb3f5bcc0b793fc2.mp4?t=1746352603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hidden Tomatoes is a fun and relaxing hidden object game where your task is to find 100 hidden tomatoes scattered throughout a bustling urban environment. Explore vibrant cityscapes, each filled with cleverly hidden tomatoes waiting to be discovered. <br> <br>With soothing background music and a calming atmosphere, this game offers a relaxing experience as you uncover each tomato in urban scenes. <br> <br>Gameplay: <br>\ud83c\udf45 1 Level, 100 hidden tomatoes in a city setting.   <br>\ud83d\udc49 Click on the tomatoes you find. <br> <br>Features: <br>- Explore a lively city with beautifully designed urban landscape.   <br>- No time limits\u2014take your time and enjoy the hunt.   <br>- Fun and challenging for players of all ages. <br> <br>Can you find all the hidden tomatoes in the city? Start your adventure now!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367590/extras/d50a7a89e6185ba5cb3f5bcc0b793fc2.poster.avif?t=1746352603\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367590/extras/d50a7a89e6185ba5cb3f5bcc0b793fc2.webm?t=1746352603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367590/extras/d50a7a89e6185ba5cb3f5bcc0b793fc2.mp4?t=1746352603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hidden Tomatoes is a fun and relaxing hidden object game where your task is to find 100 hidden tomatoes scattered throughout a bustling urban environment. Explore vibrant cityscapes, each filled with cleverly hidden tomatoes waiting to be discovered. <br> <br>With soothing background music and a calming atmosphere, this game offers a relaxing experience as you uncover each tomato in urban scenes. <br> <br>Gameplay: <br>\ud83c\udf45 1 Level, 100 hidden tomatoes in a city setting.   <br>\ud83d\udc49 Click on the tomatoes you find. <br> <br>Features: <br>- Explore a lively city with beautifully designed urban landscape.   <br>- No time limits\u2014take your time and enjoy the hunt.   <br>- Fun and challenging for players of all ages. <br> <br>Can you find all the hidden tomatoes in the city? Start your adventure now!",
    "short_description": "Hidden Tomatoes is a relaxing hidden object game where you search for 100 hidden tomatoes in a detailed city environment. Explore the streets, buildings, and alleys at your own pace, with no time limits or pressure. Can you spot all the tomatoes? \ud83c\udf45",
